<doc id="106093" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=106093" title="6666 Peternakan">
6666 Peternakan

The Four Sixes Ranch, stylized salaku 6666 Ranch, mangrupikeun ranch di King County, Texas, ogé Carson County sareng Hutchinson County.
<h2>Lokasi</h2>
Lokasi.
Bagian utama ranch perenahna caket kota Guthrie di King County, Texas. Ieu ngawengku 350,000 acres (550 sq kuring; 140.000 ha) tanah. Imah ranch utama pareum US Highway 82. Bagian Dixon Creek ngalegaan 108,000 acres (169 sq kuring; 44.000 ha) lahan di Carson sareng Hutchinson county. Dixon Creek ngalir ngaliwatan bagian ieu ranch deukeut Panhandle, Texas.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Ranch ieu diadegkeun ku Samuel Burk Burnett di 1900 saatos anjeunna ngagaleuh lahan ti Louisville Land and Cattle Company. Katerangan nyatakeun yén anjeunna meunang ranch tina kaulinan kartu, dimana anjeunna ngoleksi opat genep. Tapi, Burnett sareng turunanna nampik dongéng folklor ieu. Gantina, ngaran asalna tina gerombolan munggaran anjeunna diangkat dina ranch, nu ieu branded "6666".
Burnett ngangkat banteng Herefords sareng Durham murni, anu meunang hadiah nasional dina acara peternakan di sakuliah Amérika Serikat. Anjeunna ogé jawa kuda suku murni. Dina 1918, 2.000 sirah sapi tiwas ku badai salju. Tilu taun ti harita, dina 1921, minyak kapanggih dina ranch, sahingga ngarobahna kana perusahaan pisan nguntungkeun.
Saatos pupusna Burnett di 1920, ranch ieu diwariskeun ku incu awewena, Anne Valliant Burnett Tandy. Anjeunna ngagaleuh Gray Badger II sareng Hollywood Gold, dua kuda acara anu cicing di ranch. Ku 1936, aya 20.000 sapi Hereford di ranch. Dina taun 1960-an jeung 1970-an, lumbung di ranch dipaké dina iklan Marlboro, merek roko. Dina 1975, pamandangan pilem Mackintosh jeung TJ syuting di ranch.
Dina 1980, ranch ieu dibikeun ka buyut Burnett urang, Anne Windfohr Marion, jeung buyut-incu awewe na, Wendi Grimes. Marion ko-manajemén ranch jeung salaki kaopat nya, John L. Marion. Aranjeunna ngabina sapi Brangus sareng Herefords pikeun ngahasilkeun Baldy Hideung, hiji breed sapi tahan laleur cedar. Saratus broodmares jawa di ranch unggal taun.
As of 3 December 2020[update], the ranch was being sold in accordance with the will of owner Anne Burnett Marion, who had died in February that year; it was listed on the market for a total of $347.7 million.[] In May 2021, a buyer group represented by &lt;a href="screenwriter"&gt;screenwriter&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Taylor%20Sheridan"&gt;Taylor Sheridan&lt;/a&gt; purchased the ranch.
Lukisan ngagambarkeun porsi ranch geus dicét ku Tom Ryan jeung Mondel Rogers. Lumbung ti ranch geus dipindahkeun ka National Ranching Warisan Center di Lubbock, Texas.
<h2>Dina budaya populér</h2>
Dina budaya populér.
Séri televisi anu henteu namina dumasar kana ranch diwanohkeun salaku pilot backdoor, salami usum kaopat tina séri drama Yellowstone, dileupaskeun 7 Nopémber 2021, ngalangkungan jasa streaming Paramount +. Tanda ranch ogé bisa nempo dina serial drama Landman.
<h2>Aub dina Olahraga</h2>
Aub dina Olahraga.
6666 Ranch geus disponsoran mobil 23 pikeun Ryan Hunter-Reay, nyetir pikeun Dreyer &amp;amp;amp; Reinbold Racing, dina 2024 NTT IndyCar Series.

